    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to No. 34 Mountfield Park, a superb two-bedroom duplex property ideally positioned within the highly sought-after Mountfield development, just off Seamount Road. This beautifully positioned home enjoys a particularly attractive south-facing balcony, offering a wonderful outdoor space with stunning views overlooking playing fields.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of a welcoming entrance hall with a large hot press for storage, family bathroom, bright and airy open plan kitchen / living & dining area with double doors leading to a large sunny south facing balcony with a view and two spacious bedrooms both with fitted wardrobes.\r\n\r\nThis property is in a highly sought after location in Malahide. This picturesque seaside town has every imaginable amenity and Mountfield is located just a short stroll from the heart of the village. There are a whole host of shops, restaurants, bars, primary & secondary schools, and transport links all within easy reach"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall\t5.88 x 1.17\tDecorative timber floor, security alarm, coving, large hot press, 2 x light fitting\r\n\r\nFamily Bathroom\t2.66 x 1.73\tDecorative timber floor, wc, whb, bath suite, shower curtain, handheld shower head, mirror, fitted shelving unit\r\n\r\nLounge / Dining  4.43 x 3.95\tDecorative timber floor, coving, tv point, light fitting, double doors to sunny south facing balcony\r\n\r\nKitchen  2.73 x 2.15\t  Decorative timber floor, oven, hob, extractor fan, dishwasher, fitted kitchen units, new fridge / freezer\r\n\r\nBedroom 1\t5.19 x 2.41\tDecorative timber floor, fitted wardrobes, door to sunny south facing balcony\r\n\t\t\r\nBedroom 2            \t3.96 x 4.53 \tDecorative timber floor, abundance of fitted wardrobes, feature bay window overlooking green space, coving, light fitting\r\n\r\nBalcony\t6.6 x 2.15\tSunny south facing aspect, overlooking Gaelic football pitch, new deck"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tNew Boiler installed\r\n•\tGas Fired Central Heating\r\n•\tSunny South Facing Balcony\r\n•\tManagement Fee €1,500.00 pa\r\n•\tUnderground Designated Parking Space\r\n•\tNew Water Pump Installed\r\n•\tFarrow & Ball paint throughout\r\n•\tSuperb Location"
      },
      {
